@startuml
' v17 / compact state / start and end / semantics
!$STATE_COMPACT = %true()
!include ../../styles/style-ink-and-signal.puml
title 工单生命周期：紧凑状态图
state "已创建" as Created <<low>>
state "调查中" as Investigating <<mid>>
state "待复核" as Escalated <<high>>
state "已关闭" as Closed <<ok>>
[*] --> Created
Created --> Investigating : 领取工单
Investigating --> Escalated : 发现高风险证据
Investigating --> Closed : 排除异常
Escalated --> Closed : 复核完成
Closed --> [*]
@enduml
